# gem_row authoring plan (records fixtures/padlogs/gem_row.padlog, --config none --stop-at 6300): NEW GAME on an empty card
# (hub_entry.plan's presses anchored on the GameController states), then the pause screen three times on N. Sanity Beach:
# before any gem; after the red gem (Crash warped onto it and back to the start, no save point passed); after five drops onto
# the beach's nitro crates, the GAME OVER and CONTINUE (the restart from the save's snapshot, the new game's). The recording's
# "[te.test]" lines are the fixture's TE_TEST_ACTIONS (fixtures/judges/gem_row_pal.json, the pad log's `# test=` line).
until-gstate 7 3000
idle 11
hold START 5
until-gstate 8 300
idle 128
hold CROSS 5
idle 295
hold UP 3
idle 97
hold CROSS 3
idle 247
hold DOWN 3
idle 67
hold CROSS 3
until-gstate 12 2000
idle 151
hold CROSS 3
wait 30
hold START 5
idle 120
hold START 5
idle 30
wait 30
teleport -28.035 8.17 -7.80
wait 90
teleport 0.235 0.046 -40.256
wait 60
hold START 5
idle 120
hold START 5
idle 30
wait 30
teleport -24.6 1.6 -4.8
wait 400
teleport -24.1 1.6 -14.3
wait 400
teleport -17.3 1.6 -5.1
wait 400
teleport -20.5 1.6 -3.3
wait 400
teleport -20.2 1.6 -13.7
until-gstate 18 2000
idle 200
hold CROSS 3
until-gstate 12 4000
wait 90
hold START 5
idle 120
stop
